(320, 105, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"6ea22cfe\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"66a46138\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><img class=\\\"size-full wp-image-141 aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/ekart\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/iobte2xsyko.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"V\\u1ec1 ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i\\\" width=\\\"1600\\\" height=\\\"1067\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong>Ch\\u00e0o m\\u1eebng b\\u1ea1n \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi website th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i!<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h3><h3 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #7a7a7a; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; font-size: 1.6rem; font-style: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-transform: inherit;\\\">Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t nh\\u00f3m sinh vi\\u00ean tr\\u1ebb \\u0111\\u1ebfn t\\u1eeb <\\/span><strong style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #7a7a7a; text-align: start; font-size: 1.6rem; font-style: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-transform: inherit;\\\" data-start=\\\"249\\\" data-end=\\\"295\\\">Tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u0110\\u1ea1i h\\u1ecdc C\\u00f4ng nghi\\u1ec7p TP. H\\u1ed3 Ch\\u00ed Minh<\\/strong><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #7a7a7a; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; font-size: 1.6rem; font-style: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-transform: inherit;\\\">, c\\u00f9ng chung ni\\u1ec1m \\u0111am m\\u00ea c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7 v\\u00e0 kh\\u00e1t khao kh\\u1edfi nghi\\u1ec7p trong l\\u0129nh v\\u1ef1c <\\/span><strong style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #7a7a7a; text-align: start; font-size: 1.6rem; font-style: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-transform: inherit;\\\" data-start=\\\"370\\\" data-end=\\\"392\\\">th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed<\\/strong><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #7a7a7a; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; font-size: 1.6rem; font-style: inherit; letter-spacing: 0.01em; text-transform: inherit;\\\">.<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"395\\\" data-end=\\\"658\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">D\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n website n\\u00e0y kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t b\\u00e0i t\\u1eadp h\\u1ecdc thu\\u1eadt trong m\\u00f4n <b>Th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed<\\/b>, m\\u00e0 c\\u00f2n l\\u00e0 b\\u01b0\\u1edbc kh\\u1edfi \\u0111\\u1ea7u cho <strong data-start=\\\"508\\\" data-end=\\\"530\\\">\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng kinh doanh<\\/strong>\\u00a0x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng m\\u1ed9t n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng b\\u00e1n h\\u00e0ng tr\\u1ef1c tuy\\u1ebfn th\\u00e2n thi\\u1ec7n, hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3 v\\u00e0 d\\u1ec5 ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"660\\\" data-end=\\\"978\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">D\\u1ef1a tr\\u00ean n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng <strong data-start=\\\"678\\\" data-end=\\\"691\\\">WordPress<\\/strong>, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i t\\u1eadp trung ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n giao di\\u1ec7n hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i, t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng linh ho\\u1ea1t v\\u00e0 tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u.<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/h3><h5 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">M\\u1ee5c ti\\u00eau<\\/span><\\/h5><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">T\\u1ea1o ra m\\u1ed9t giao di\\u1ec7n th\\u00e2n thi\\u1ec7n, d\\u1ec5 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng v\\u00e0 m\\u00f4 ph\\u1ecfng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c quy tr\\u00ecnh ho\\u1ea1t \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a m\\u1ed9t website th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p \\u2013 t\\u1eeb vi\\u1ec7c tr\\u01b0ng b\\u00e0y s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m, \\u0111\\u1eb7t h\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn thanh to\\u00e1n.<\\/span><\\/p><h4 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1136\\\" data-end=\\\"1268\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1136\\\" data-end=\\\"1149\\\">T\\u1ea7m nh\\u00ecn<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1136\\\" data-end=\\\"1268\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh th\\u1ebf h\\u1ec7 ti\\u00ean phong trong vi\\u1ec7c \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7 \\u0111\\u1ec3 t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u h\\u00f3a tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m mua s\\u1eafm tr\\u1ef1c tuy\\u1ebfn t\\u1ea1i Vi\\u1ec7t Nam.<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1270\\\" data-end=\\\"1419\\\">\\u00a0<\\/h3><h4 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1270\\\" data-end=\\\"1419\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1270\\\" data-end=\\\"1282\\\">S\\u1ee9 m\\u1ec7nh<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\" data-start=\\\"1270\\\" data-end=\\\"1419\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn nh\\u1eefng gi\\u1ea3i ph\\u00e1p th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng m\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n t\\u1eed hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3, d\\u1ec5 ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 c\\u00f3 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng m\\u1edf r\\u1ed9ng cho c\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1ed3ng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng v\\u00e0 doanh nghi\\u1ec7p nh\\u1ecf.<\\/span><\\/p><h3 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\u00a0<\\/h3><h4 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb c\\u1ed1t l\\u00f5i<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">Trong qu\\u00e1 tr\\u00ecnh x\\u00e2y d\\u1ef1ng v\\u00e0 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n d\\u1ef1 \\u00e1n, ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i x\\u00e1c \\u0111\\u1ecbnh r\\u00f5 nh\\u1eefng gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb c\\u1ed1t l\\u00f5i l\\u00e0m n\\u1ec1n t\\u1ea3ng cho m\\u1ecdi quy\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ecbnh v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u1ecbnh h\\u01b0\\u1edbng c\\u1ee7a nh\\u00f3m<\\/span><\\/p><table class=\\\" aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"width: 27.5872%; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">1.<\\/span> <strong>Ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"width: 39.0794%; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">2.<\\/span> <strong>T\\u1eadn t\\u00e2m &amp; H\\u01b0\\u1edbng t\\u1edbi ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">3.<\\/span> <strong>T\\u1ef1 Tin<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 27.5872%; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">4.<\\/span> <strong>Th\\u00edch Nghi \\u0110\\u1ec3 Thay \\u0110\\u1ed5i<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"width: 39.0794%; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">5.<\\/span> <strong>Ni\\u1ec1m \\u0110am M\\u00ea<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"width: 33.3333%; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 14pt;\\\">6.<\\/span> <strong>\\u0110\\u1ea1o \\u0110\\u1ee9c &amp; T\\u00e0i N\\u0103ng<\\/strong><\\/span><\\/td><\\/tr><\\/tbody><\\/table><h4 style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ed9i ng\\u0169 qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd<\\/span><\\/h4><table class=\\\" aligncenter\\\" style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\\\"><tbody><tr><td style=\\\"width: 50%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><img class=\\\"aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/cdn11.dienmaycholon.vn\\/filewebdmclnew\\/public\\/userupload\\/files\\/Image%20FP_2024\\/hinh-anh-avatar-ca-tinh-nu-9.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"H\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh avatar c\\u00e1 t\\u00ednh n\\u1eef HOT nh\\u1ea5t n\\u0103m\\\" width=\\\"332\\\" height=\\\"332\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"width: 50%;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><img class=\\\"aligncenter\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/image.dienthoaivui.com.vn\\/x,webp,q90\\/https:\\/\\/dashboard.dienthoaivui.com.vn\\/uploads\\/dashboard\\/editor_upload\\/avatar-anime-nu-03.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Avatar anime n\\u1eef ng\\u1ea7u nh\\u1ea5t 2025\\\" width=\\\"331\\\" height=\\\"331\\\" \\/><\\/span><\\/td><\\/tr><tr><td style=\\\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong>Hu\\u1ef3nh Minh Th\\u01b0<\\/strong> _ 21117441<br \\/>SDT: 0918878785<br \\/>Email: hmthu2479@gmail.com<\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\"><strong>Tr\\u1ea7n B\\u1ea3o Ng\\u1ecdc<\\/strong> _ 21118081<br \\/>SDT: 0387130279<br \\/>Email:\\u00a0<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\\\">tr